==================================================
9. PAYMENT CALLBACK
==================================================

Audit the existing callback page rather than rebuilding it.

Verify:

Successful payment:
→ verified state
→ order number
→ total
→ clear confirmation
→ continue shopping

Failed payment:
→ clear explanation
→ retry payment for SAME ORDER

Abandoned payment:
→ retry option

Invalid reference:
→ safe error state

Network/verification failure:
→ retry verification

Browser refresh:
→ remains idempotent

Webhook already processed:
→ callback still shows successful payment

Do not claim payment success merely because Paystack redirected the browser.

Backend verification remains authoritative.

